<mxCell id="t740" value="Rule: every branch must shrink [lo, hi). arr[mid] &lt; target rules mid out, so lo = mid + 1; otherwise mid may be the answer, so hi = mid. With hi = len(arr), the result can also be len(arr) when every value is smaller." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="330" width="820" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t741" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; [1, 3] with target 3 hangs. Fix: lo = mid + 1 (and hi = len(arr) for a half-open range)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="372" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
