<mxCell id="t1633" value="Heap never holds more than K = 3 entries, so each line costs O(log K).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Total &lt;b&gt;O(N log K)&lt;/b&gt; time, &lt;b&gt;O(K)&lt;/b&gt; memory, and the logs can be streams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The server index in each entry breaks timestamp ties without comparing payloads." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="224" width="220" height="182" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="t1634" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; K-way merge with a min-heap: O(N log K) time, O(K) memory. Output: a-boot, c-boot, b-boot, b-warn, a-ok, b-ok." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="418" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
